          "author": "Siman Nuurali",
          "description": "When his father goes on a business trip, Sadiq worries he'll miss his baba too much. But Baba has a story for Sadiq: the story of the Desert Star. Learning about Baba's passion for the stars sparks Sadiq's interest in outer space. But can Sadiq find others who are willing to help him start the space club of his dreams?\n\nThis is a read-along story.",
